{{Quote|The Yost system will not be safe for your friends at all.|AP-5 interrupts [[Hera Syndulla]], who was planning on retreating to the Yost system|<ref name="TFD" />}}
The '''Yost system''',<ref name="TFD Episode Gallery">{{SW|url=series/star-wars-rebels/the-forgotten-droid-episode-guide|text="The Forgotten Droid" Episode Guide &#124; Star Wars Rebels}}</ref> or '''Berzite system'''<ref name="Appendix" /> was a [[star system]] in [[Wild Space]], on the edge of the [[Outer Rim Territories]] in grid square U-8 of the [[Standard Galactic Grid]].<ref name="Map">{{StarWarsGalaxyMap}}</ref> It was [[orbit]]ed by the [[planet]] [[Berzite]], which itself had a [[Berzite's moon|moon]].

==History==
In [[3 BBY]], after an extensive search for a secure [[Planet|world]] to house a new base, the [[Spectres]] managed to cross-reference [[Galactic Republic|Republic]] and [[Lasat]] star maps and found that a [[Berzite's moon|moon of Berzite]] in<ref name="TFD" /> the Yost system<ref name="TFD Episode Gallery">{{SW|url=series/star-wars-rebels/the-forgotten-droid-episode-guide|text="The Forgotten Droid" Episode Guide &#124; Star Wars Rebels}}</ref> was suitable for the purpose. However, the trip was delayed as the rebels' stolen [[Quasar Fire-class cruiser-carrier|Imperial cruiser-carrier]] did not have enough [[fuel]] to make the journey. Thus, the Spectres traveled to [[Horizon Base]], an [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] refueling station, to [[Heist at Horizon Base|steal]] necessary fuel. There, one of the rebels, [[astromech droid]] [[C1-10P|Chopper]], was separated and stowed away aboard an [[Class four container transport|Imperial cargo ship]]. He soon befriended a [[protocol droid]] designated [[AP-5]] and together, they managed to commandeer the vessel. After learning that the rebels planned on stationing their base in the Yost system, the Empire set a trap in the area. When AP-5 heard where the rebels intended to retreat, aware of the Imperial trap, he instead recommended the planet [[Atollon]].<ref name="TFD" />

{{System-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The [[Disney+]] subtitles for "[[The Forgotten Droid]]" spell the system as the Yawst System.<ref name="Subtitles">{{Rebels|The Forgotten Droid}} {{Subtitles|Disney+}}</ref>

